      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** immediately before that process starts. Specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent (or Query agent) child process\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated and never holds the key\n\nThis design ensures that a compromised or misbehaving Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables \u2014 the key exists only in the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API.",
